flowchart LR
  Researcher[Researcher] -->|question or approved job| Entry[Notebook, CLI, or HTTPS API]
  Entry --> Validate[Compatibility and schema validation]
  Evidence[(Versioned evidence corpus)] --> Retrieve[Evidence retrieval]
  Validate --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Plan[Typed workflow plan and citations]
  Plan --> Rules[Scientific rules and unsupported-claim checks]
  Rules -->|unsupported| Abstain[Abstention with reason]
  Rules -->|review required| Review[Human review checkpoint]
  Review -->|approved| Execute[Allowlisted execution]
  Rules -->|safe deterministic lookup| Execute
  Inputs[(Versioned PFAS artifacts)] --> Execute
  Execute --> Results[(Results, hashes, metrics, and provenance)]

  subgraph AWS[Approval-gated AWS target]
    ALB[Existing HTTPS Application Load Balancer] --> ECS[Amazon ECS Fargate API]
    ECR[(Amazon ECR immutable images)] --> ECS
    S3[(Amazon S3 versioned artifacts)] --> ECS
    ECS --> CW[Amazon CloudWatch]
    SM[Secrets Manager] -. optional scoped secret .-> ECS
    Train[Optional bounded SageMaker job] <--> S3
  end

  GHA[CI and approved release with OIDC] --> ECR
  GHA --> ECS
  Entry -. cloud request .-> ALB
  S3 -. approved input snapshot .-> Inputs
  Results -. approved artifact publication .-> S3
